00:38:20,570 --> 00:38:22,540
<font size="64">The BBQ restaurant will probably be popular.</font>

1566
00:38:23,170 --> 00:38:24,340
<font size="64">Let's check out the condition there.</font>

1567
00:38:24,540 --> 00:38:25,710
<font size="64">Let's check out the mission.</font>

1568
00:38:25,940 --> 00:38:27,210
<font size="64">Let's see what the condition is.</font>

1569
00:38:26,080 --> 00:38:29,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What does it take to complete the mission at the popular place?)</font>

1570
00:38:27,380 --> 00:38:29,750
<font size="64">I should go to all the restaurants to know the conditions.</font>

1571
00:38:30,050 --> 00:38:31,810
<font size="64">Are we here? We're here.</font>

1572
00:38:30,150 --> 00:38:32,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha arrives at the BBQ restaurant.)</font>

1573
00:38:31,980 --> 00:38:34,450
<font size="64">Goodness. Look who's here.</font>

1574
00:38:34,450 --> 00:38:35,950
<font size="64">Hold on. Don't get out yet.</font>

1575
00:38:36,620 --> 00:38:38,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Someone is already here.)</font>

1576
00:38:38,120 --> 00:38:39,220
<font size="64">Woo Min.</font>

1577
00:38:38,490 --> 00:38:39,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's Woo Min.)</font>

1578
00:38:39,490 --> 00:38:41,760
<font size="64">- What's the mission here? - To come in pairs.</font>

1579
00:38:39,790 --> 00:38:42,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What are the conditions for completing the mission?)</font>

1580
00:38:42,690 --> 00:38:45,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Man-woman couples)</font>

1581
00:38:43,160 --> 00:38:45,190
<font size="64">- Man-woman couples. - Man-woman couples.</font>

1582
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:47,730
<font size="64">- Man-woman couples. - Man-woman couples.</font>

1583
00:38:46,060 --> 00:38:48,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(BBQ restaurant: Man-woman couples)</font>

1584
00:38:48,900 --> 00:38:50,170
<font size="64">Man-woman couples.</font>

1585
00:38:49,070 --> 00:38:52,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The female members have to show up for the mission to succeed.)</font>

1586
00:38:50,170 --> 00:38:51,770
<font size="64">- Are you the only one here? - Yes.</font>

1587
00:38:52,600 --> 00:38:53,940
<font size="64">- I'll check the other restaurants. - If only one...</font>

1588
00:38:52,640 --> 00:38:54,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Man-woman couples)</font>

1589
00:38:53,940 --> 00:38:55,770
<font size="64">- Go ahead. - Okay.</font>

1590
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:56,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Without hesitation)</font>

1591
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:59,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Woo Min will stay at the BBQ restaurant.)</font>

1592
00:38:56,740 --> 00:38:59,240
<font size="64">I could have a big advantage there.</font>

1593
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:01,680
<font size="64">People are gathering here.</font>

1594
00:39:01,680 --> 00:39:03,050
<font size="64">There are two vans here, right?</font>

1595
00:39:03,050 --> 00:39:05,680
<font size="64">We have to go around to all the restaurants.</font>

1596
00:39:03,250 --> 00:39:06,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Two cars are coming.)</font>

1597
00:39:06,350 --> 00:39:08,150
<font size="64">Please let it be a woman.</font>

1598
00:39:08,680 --> 00:39:12,150
<font size="64">If just one woman gets out...</font>

1599
00:39:09,850 --> 00:39:13,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will the men and women be able to pair up?)</font>

1600
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:14,160
<font size="64">Why aren't they getting out?</font>

1601
00:39:15,960 --> 00:39:17,460
<font size="64">Isn't that one of the members' vans?</font>

1602
00:39:16,060 --> 00:39:18,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's nervous.)</font>

1603
00:39:19,330 --> 00:39:20,930
<font size="64">Wait. You can see it from here.</font>

1604
00:39:19,560 --> 00:39:22,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Mr. Jee is testing the waters.)</font>

1605
00:39:21,830 --> 00:39:23,470
<font size="64">Man-woman...</font>

1606
00:39:23,470 --> 00:39:25,840
<font size="64">You need to come as a man-woman couple.</font>

1607
00:39:25,840 --> 00:39:27,340
<font size="64">I should give Ji Hyo a call.</font>

1608
00:39:28,700 --> 00:39:31,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Woo Min bravely approaches the van.)</font>

1609
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:33,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's suddenly very enthusiastic.)</font>

1610
00:39:33,180 --> 00:39:34,540
<font size="64">- Seok Jin. - Yes?</font>

1611
00:39:35,540 --> 00:39:37,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's talking with Ji Hyo.)</font>

1612
00:39:36,010 --> 00:39:37,280
<font size="64">- How many people went there? - Did you arrive?</font>

1613
00:39:37,280 --> 00:39:38,480
<font size="64">What's the condition there?</font>

1614
00:39:38,480 --> 00:39:39,820
<font size="64">I haven't...</font>

1615
00:39:39,820 --> 00:39:41,180
<font size="64">A grasshopper!</font>

1616
00:39:41,180 --> 00:39:42,550
<font size="64">- I haven't... - A grasshopper!</font>

1617
00:39:43,250 --> 00:39:45,250
<font size="64">A grasshopper! There's a grasshopper!</font>

1618
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:48,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He said goodbye earlier. Why is he here?)</font>

1619
00:39:45,790 --> 00:39:47,320
<font size="64">The grasshopper came inside.</font>

1620
00:39:47,460 --> 00:39:48,560
<font size="64">It's the grasshopper from earlier.</font>

1621
00:39:48,690 --> 00:39:51,560
<font size="64">It will lose its family if it comes with us.</font>

1622
00:39:48,690 --> 00:39:51,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He thought he had left the grasshopper behind,)</font>

1623
00:39:52,730 --> 00:39:55,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(but Jae Seok clung to his butt and came with him!)</font>

1624
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:55,700
<font size="64">- Should I sit here? - Yes, that's right.</font>

1625
00:39:55,700 --> 00:39:56,830
<font size="64">It's the grasshopper from earlier. See?</font>

1626
00:39:56,830 --> 00:39:58,800
<font size="64">I told you to get out of the car earlier.</font>

1627
00:39:59,140 --> 00:40:00,840
<font size="64">You should have gotten out of the car there.</font>

1628
00:40:01,270 --> 00:40:03,740
<font size="64">You don't feel like a stranger, Grasshopper.</font>

1629
00:40:03,770 --> 00:40:05,810
<font size="64">I gave you advice because you didn't feel like a stranger.</font>

1630
00:40:04,240 --> 00:40:07,540
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Upset)</font>

1631
00:40:05,810 --> 00:40:07,310
<font size="64">Why did you get in the car with us?</font>

1632
00:40:07,310 --> 00:40:08,380
<font size="64">You're talking about a real grasshopper,</font>

1633
00:40:08,380 --> 00:40:09,450
<font size="64">- not our Grasshopper? - It's not our Grasshopper.</font>

1634
00:40:09,450 --> 00:40:10,650
<font size="64">It's a real grasshopper.</font>

1635
00:40:10,710 --> 00:40:13,550
<font size="64">I feel bad for the grasshopper.</font>

1636
00:40:13,250 --> 00:40:15,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stuck to Seok Sam like glue)</font>

1637
00:40:13,950 --> 00:40:15,580
<font size="64">I should drop it later.</font>

1638
00:40:15,720 --> 00:40:16,950
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

1639
00:40:15,850 --> 00:40:18,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Woo Min spotted Seok Sam and Grasshopper.)</font>

1640
00:40:18,790 --> 00:40:22,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is there a female member in this van?)</font>

1641
00:40:19,320 --> 00:40:20,490
<font size="64">I can't see anything here.</font>

1642
00:40:25,030 --> 00:40:27,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's not a woman again.)</font>

1643
00:40:28,460 --> 00:40:31,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hoon was hiding in cover for no reason.)</font>

1644
00:40:29,500 --> 00:40:30,700
<font size="64">Why isn't he entering?</font>

1645
00:40:30,970 --> 00:40:32,900
<font size="64">I should check.</font>

1646
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:35,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He gets out first.)</font>

1647
00:40:35,240 --> 00:40:36,240
<font size="64">- Woo Min. - Hoon.</font>

1648
00:40:36,240 --> 00:40:37,270
<font size="64">Are you the only one here?</font>

1649
00:40:36,370 --> 00:40:39,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(There are 4 men at the BBQ restaurant.)</font>

1650
00:40:37,470 --> 00:40:38,640
<font size="64">Are you the only one here?</font>

1651
00:40:38,640 --> 00:40:40,010
<font size="64">- I'm the only one here. - Really?</font>

1652
00:40:40,010 --> 00:40:41,380
<font size="64">Why didn't more come to the BBQ place?</font>

1653
00:40:40,880 --> 00:40:43,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hoon checked the mission as well.)</font>

1654
00:40:41,380 --> 00:40:43,350
<font size="64">- I know, right? - If we go in...</font>

1655
00:40:43,350 --> 00:40:44,410
<font size="64">We have to enter in man-woman couples here.</font>

1656
00:40:43,450 --> 00:40:47,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's the requirement.)</font>

1657
00:40:44,410 --> 00:40:46,350
<font size="64">- But it's just you and me. - Exactly.</font>

1658
00:40:47,550 --> 00:40:50,150
<font size="64">- There's Seok Jin as well. - Seok Jin is here too?</font>

1659
00:40:47,750 --> 00:40:50,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Oh, right.)</font>

1660
00:40:50,150 --> 00:40:51,650
<font size="64">- Guys! - Seok Jin!</font>

1661
00:40:51,650 --> 00:40:53,860
<font size="64">- You'll fail if you just stay here. - We can't go in here.</font>

1662
00:40:53,860 --> 00:40:55,420
<font size="64">We have to enter in man-woman couples here.</font>

1663
00:40:55,420 --> 00:40:57,860
<font size="64">I saw it from a distance. Isn't that the condition?</font>

1664
00:40:57,860 --> 00:40:59,300
<font size="64">You should just leave, then.</font>

1665
00:40:59,300 --> 00:41:00,430
<font size="64">What about you?</font>

1666
00:41:00,430 --> 00:41:01,760
<font size="64">I'll stay here for a bit.</font>

1667
00:41:01,760 --> 00:41:02,930
<font size="64">You should leave.</font>

1668
00:41:03,470 --> 00:41:05,230
<font size="64">- Where should I go? - If the three of us stay here...</font>

1669
00:41:05,230 --> 00:41:06,800
<font size="64">We have three female guests today.</font>

1670
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:08,100
<font size="64">All three of them have to come here for us to enter.</font>

1671
00:41:08,540 --> 00:41:09,710
<font size="64">That's true.</font>

1672
00:41:08,600 --> 00:41:11,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The old man shows up last and kicks everyone else out.)</font>

1673
00:41:09,710 --> 00:41:11,140
<font size="64">It's impossible to eat from here.</font>

1674
00:41:11,140 --> 00:41:13,040
<font size="64">You have the lowest chance...</font>

1675
00:41:13,080 --> 00:41:14,210
<font size="64">of succeeding here.</font>

1676
00:41:15,140 --> 00:41:17,080
<font size="64">- Then I'll... - Are you going to leave?</font>

1677
00:41:15,610 --> 00:41:18,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hoon leaves for now.)</font>

1678
00:41:17,080 --> 00:41:18,250
<font size="64">- check out the other restaurants. - Okay.</font>

1679
00:41:18,550 --> 00:41:21,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Yoo Myung and Seok Sam are left.)</font>

1680
00:41:18,580 --> 00:41:20,220
<font size="64">We need two female members to come here.</font>

1681
00:41:20,220 --> 00:41:21,520
<font size="64">- That's right. - Right?</font>

1682
00:41:22,250 --> 00:41:25,220
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Where is Hye Jun, a female guest, going?)</font>

1683
00:41:23,150 --> 00:41:24,320
<font size="64">We're here.</font>

1684
00:41:25,090 --> 00:41:26,960
<font size="64">Goodness. I guess I'm the only one here!</font>

1685
00:41:28,160 --> 00:41:29,360
<font size="64">Thank you.</font>

1686
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:31,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Which restaurant did Hye Jun come to?)</font>

1687
00:41:31,830 --> 00:41:34,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She chose the Chinese restaurant, as she mentioned earlier.)</font>

1688
00:41:37,270 --> 00:41:39,800
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What's the condition for the Chinese restaurant?)</font>

1689
00:41:39,800 --> 00:41:42,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Odd number)</font>

1690
00:41:40,100 --> 00:41:41,170
<font size="64">Can I go in?</font>

1691
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:42,470
<font size="64">Oh no.</font>

1692
00:41:43,170 --> 00:41:44,340
<font size="64">We need an odd number of people present.</font>

1693
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:45,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chinese restaurant: Odd number)</font>

1694
00:41:45,240 --> 00:41:48,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sundaeguk restaurant: Combined age of 120 to 150)</font>

1695
00:41:45,370 --> 00:41:47,180
<font size="64">It'll be game over if someone joins me.</font>

1696
00:41:47,510 --> 00:41:48,680
<font size="64">I don't think anyone will come though.</font>

1697
00:41:49,310 --> 00:41:50,410
<font size="64">Am I the only one here?</font>

1698
00:41:51,110 --> 00:41:53,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(No one's here!)</font>

1699
00:41:52,680 --> 00:41:53,950
<font size="64">What if...</font>

1700
00:41:55,320 --> 00:41:56,720
<font size="64">no one else comes?</font>

1701
00:41:56,920 --> 00:41:58,120
<font size="64">Do I really get to keep all 30 gold bars?</font>

1702
00:41:59,020 --> 00:42:01,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Wishing as hard and fast as possible)</font>

1703
00:41:59,420 --> 00:42:00,520
<font size="64">It'll be an odd number of people.</font>

1704
00:42:01,660 --> 00:42:03,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Rattling)</font>

1705
00:42:04,090 --> 00:42:06,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Her wishes come to a sudden halt.)</font>

1706
00:42:07,260 --> 00:42:10,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She gets all the gold if she's the only one here.)</font>

1707
00:42:11,530 --> 00:42:14,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Someone's here.)</font>

1708
00:42:12,940 --> 00:42:14,300
<font size="64">Someone's here.</font>

1709
00:42:14,740 --> 00:42:17,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Her dream is crushed in just 3 seconds.)</font>

1710
00:42:17,640 --> 00:42:19,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sighing)</font>

1711
00:42:20,180 --> 00:42:22,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hello!)</font>

1712
00:42:21,410 --> 00:42:22,410
<font size="64">Oh dear.</font>

1713
00:42:22,680 --> 00:42:25,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Yang Ssaebssaeb enters the Chinese restaurant.)</font>

1714
00:42:23,510 --> 00:42:24,550
<font size="64">What happened?</font>

1715
00:42:24,550 --> 00:42:26,380
<font size="64">I was hoping to get all the gold.</font>

1716
00:42:25,310 --> 00:42:26,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chinese restaurant: Odd number)</font>

1717
00:42:26,450 --> 00:42:27,850
<font size="64">Well, in your dreams.</font>

1718
00:42:26,880 --> 00:42:29,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Now that there are 2 people, the number is even.)</font>

1719
00:42:28,450 --> 00:42:29,690
<font size="64">We need an odd headcount.</font>

1720
00:42:29,850 --> 00:42:31,420
<font size="64">Yes. Either one more person joins us,</font>

1721
00:42:31,890 --> 00:42:33,020
<font size="64">or you have to leave.</font>

1722
00:42:33,390 --> 00:42:34,590
<font size="64">Am I the one who has to leave?</font>

1723
00:42:34,960 --> 00:42:36,390
<font size="64">I won't be able to accept that deal.</font>

1724
00:42:35,290 --> 00:42:37,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Brazen)</font>

1725
00:42:36,930 --> 00:42:37,960
<font size="64">What do you want to have?</font>

1726
00:42:37,960 --> 00:42:40,230
<font size="64">Me? Chinese naengmyeon.</font>

1727
00:42:40,230 --> 00:42:42,100
<font size="64">- They don't have that? - Hey, they have mul naengmyeon.</font>

1728
00:42:42,100 --> 00:42:44,200
<font size="64">Odd-number naengmyeon! Wait, that didn't make sense.</font>

1729
00:42:44,200 --> 00:42:46,170
<font size="64">- They don't have that? - Hey, they have mul naengmyeon.</font>

1730
00:42:44,530 --> 00:42:46,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Barging in)</font>

1731
00:42:46,170 --> 00:42:48,200
<font size="64">Odd number naengmyeon! Wait, that didn't make sense.</font>

1732
00:42:46,300 --> 00:42:48,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(One more odd-number naengmyeon!)</font>

1733
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:49,570
<font size="64">- What does that even mean? - An odd number...</font>

1734
00:42:49,570 --> 00:42:51,640
<font size="64">- I meant we're an odd number. - Okay, we're good.</font>

1735
00:42:50,570 --> 00:42:51,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chinese restaurant: Odd number)</font>

1736
00:42:51,770 --> 00:42:53,840
<font size="64">It's just the three of us. I thought you wanted barbecue.</font>

1737
00:42:51,870 --> 00:42:56,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Including Ye Eun, it's an odd number again.)</font>

1738
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:56,550
<font size="64">I came here thinking more people would go there.</font>

1739
00:42:56,550 --> 00:42:57,850
<font size="64">They have mul naengmyeon.</font>

1740
00:42:57,850 --> 00:42:59,850
<font size="64">- No Chinese naengmyeon though. - I'm good with mul naengmyeon.</font>

1741
00:42:59,320 --> 00:43:01,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Naengmyeon Sisters are reunited.)</font>

1742
00:43:00,550 --> 00:43:01,680
<font size="64">Please. Let it end with just us.</font>

1743
00:43:01,680 --> 00:43:03,120
<font size="64">I was by myself at first,</font>

1744
00:43:03,320 --> 00:43:04,990
<font size="64">- so I thought I was getting... - Really?</font>

1745
00:43:03,520 --> 00:43:06,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sad)</font>

1746
00:43:04,990 --> 00:43:06,020
<font size="64">all 30 gold bars.</font>

1747
00:43:06,320 --> 00:43:09,020
<font size="64">Hold on. This means we'll get ten gold bars each.</font>

1748
00:43:09,220 --> 00:43:10,890
<font size="64">Ten gold bars are a good bargain.</font>

1749
00:43:09,590 --> 00:43:11,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What?)</font>

1750
00:43:10,890 --> 00:43:12,430
<font size="64">- Exactly. - I could go somewhere else...</font>

1751
00:43:12,430 --> 00:43:15,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tiger Moth isn't content with 10 gold bars.)</font>

1752
00:43:12,430 --> 00:43:13,930
<font size="64">and get all 30 bars.</font>

1753
00:43:13,930 --> 00:43:15,260
<font size="64">- You couldn't. - Or get 15.</font>

1754
00:43:15,260 --> 00:43:16,900
<font size="64">- Think about it. - There are three of us here,</font>

1755
00:43:16,900 --> 00:43:19,230
<font size="64">so the other restaurants must have higher numbers.</font>

1756
00:43:19,440 --> 00:43:20,970
<font size="64">- I should just go. - Why?</font>

1757
00:43:19,600 --> 00:43:22,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He refuses to hear.)</font>

1758
00:43:20,970 --> 00:43:22,640
<font size="64">- What are you doing? - That means...</font>

1759
00:43:22,640 --> 00:43:24,510
<font size="64">we won't get any gold bars.</font>

1760
00:43:24,510 --> 00:43:26,040
<font size="64">- Se Chan, please. - What?</font>

1761
00:43:24,940 --> 00:43:27,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If Se Chan leaves, it becomes an even number again.)</font>

1762
00:43:26,040 --> 00:43:27,440
<font size="64">Why are you making me stay?</font>

1763
00:43:27,610 --> 00:43:29,610
<font size="64">- My donkey. - Your what?</font>

1764
00:43:29,910 --> 00:43:31,750
<font size="64">What? What are you talking about?</font>

1765
00:43:30,710 --> 00:43:33,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Coming up with his nickname in a rush)</font>

1766
00:43:31,750 --> 00:43:33,950
<font size="64">- My donkey! - Since when am I your donkey?</font>

1767
00:43:33,580 --> 00:43:36,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tadpole and Donkey are being unnecessarily dramatic.)</font>

1768
00:43:34,220 --> 00:43:36,520
<font size="64">- Tadpole, what is this? - My donkey, please.</font>

1769
00:43:36,520 --> 00:43:37,690
<font size="64">Do I look like a donkey?</font>

1770
00:43:37,850 --> 00:43:39,590
<font size="64">Because of your receding gums.</font>

1771
00:43:39,590 --> 00:43:40,620
<font size="64">My what?</font>

1772
00:43:40,620 --> 00:43:43,390
<font size="64">- Because of your receding gums. - My what?</font>

1773
00:43:41,490 --> 00:43:43,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They look alike!)</font>

1774
00:43:43,390 --> 00:43:45,360
<font size="64">Ye Eun wants to crush them herself, not that they're crushed already.</font>

1775
00:43:45,360 --> 00:43:46,400
<font size="64">- Really? - Se Chan, please.</font>

1776
00:43:46,400 --> 00:43:48,460
<font size="64">- Hold on a second. I hear you. - You can't go.</font>

1777
00:43:46,660 --> 00:43:49,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Donkey is offended.)</font>

1778
00:43:48,460 --> 00:43:49,970
<font size="64">Hold on. How long do we have?</font>

1779
00:43:50,770 --> 00:43:51,870
<font size="64">You still have a lot of time left.</font>

1780
00:43:51,870 --> 00:43:53,970
<font size="64">- I'll just see how things are. - What do you mean?</font>

1781
00:43:53,970 --> 00:43:55,840
<font size="64">- I should see how things are. - If that's the case,</font>

1782
00:43:55,940 --> 00:43:57,670
<font size="64">why don't you go with Ye Eun?</font>

1783
00:43:58,110 --> 00:43:59,610
<font size="64">Why don't you go with Ye Eun?</font>

1784
00:44:00,440 --> 00:44:02,110
<font size="64">She'll get all the gold.</font>

1785
00:44:02,540 --> 00:44:04,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

1786
00:44:04,750 --> 00:44:06,880
<font size="64">- I'll just go. - Then...</font>

1787
00:44:07,120 --> 00:44:08,180
<font size="64">I'm going with you, then.</font>

1788
00:44:08,520 --> 00:44:09,620
<font size="64">Then Hye Jun will get all the gold bars.</font>

1789
00:44:10,120 --> 00:44:11,190
<font size="64">You know what I'm saying, right?</font>

1790
00:44:10,150 --> 00:44:12,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I want both of you to leave.)</font>

1791
00:44:11,350 --> 00:44:12,760
<font size="64">It's better that way.</font>

1792
00:44:14,520 --> 00:44:15,960
<font size="64">Anyway, I'm leaving. You two stay here.</font>

1793
00:44:16,490 --> 00:44:18,330
<font size="64">I'm better off leaving.</font>

1794
00:44:17,330 --> 00:44:20,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ssaebssaeb leaves in search of a bigger payout.)</font>

1795
00:44:20,530 --> 00:44:21,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Okay.)</font>

1796
00:44:21,900 --> 00:44:23,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What about Ye Eun?)</font>

1797
00:44:23,630 --> 00:44:24,930
<font size="64">What do I do?</font>

1798
00:44:23,670 --> 00:44:26,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Staying and leaving will both hurt her.)</font>

1799
00:44:26,170 --> 00:44:29,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will it become an odd number again?)</font>

1800
00:44:26,440 --> 00:44:27,570
<font size="64">Should I get Ji Hyo over here?</font>

1801
00:44:27,600 --> 00:44:28,940
<font size="64">- What? - I can ask Ji Hyo over here.</font>

1802
00:44:29,710 --> 00:44:30,810
<font size="64">I should check...</font>

1803
00:44:30,270 --> 00:44:33,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok is at the sundaeguk restaurant.)</font>

1804
00:44:30,810 --> 00:44:32,270
<font size="64">- the conditions first. - Sure.</font>

1805
00:44:34,910 --> 00:44:36,980
<font size="64">Is this the place where our ages need to add up to 120 to 150?</font>

1806
00:44:35,480 --> 00:44:38,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Sundaeguk restaurant: Combined age of 120 to 150)</font>

1807
00:44:38,250 --> 00:44:42,650
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Since Jae Seok is 53, he needs another 67 to 97 years.)</font>

1808
00:44:43,220 --> 00:44:45,190
<font size="64">Seok Sam has to be here.</font>

1809
00:44:46,620 --> 00:44:47,960
<font size="64">Wait. Someone's here. Who is it?</font>

1810
00:44:47,160 --> 00:44:50,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Right then, 2 cars have arrived at the same time.)</font>

1811
00:44:48,820 --> 00:44:49,860
<font size="64">Who's here?</font>

1812
00:44:50,090 --> 00:44:52,630
<font size="64">We can get three people who add up to over 120.</font>

1813
00:44:53,030 --> 00:44:54,030
<font size="64">Who is it?</font>

1814
00:44:54,360 --> 00:44:56,330
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Hyo is here.)</font>

1815
00:44:54,660 --> 00:44:56,330
<font size="64">- Hey, Ji Hyo. - Jae Seok.</font>

1816
00:44:56,570 --> 00:44:57,670
<font size="64">- I thought... - Who's this?</font>

1817
00:44:57,830 --> 00:44:59,330
<font size="64">Why on earth are you here?</font>

1818
00:44:59,070 --> 00:45:01,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jong Kook also arrives at the sundaeguk restaurant.)</font>

1819
00:44:59,770 --> 00:45:01,100
<font size="64">Why else? Hold on.</font>

1820
00:45:01,100 --> 00:45:03,010
<font size="64">We're 50, 53...</font>

1821
00:45:03,640 --> 00:45:04,710
<font size="64">- That's 103. - I'm 50.</font>

1822
00:45:06,010 --> 00:45:07,110
<font size="64">- Perfect. - Really?</font>

1823
00:45:07,110 --> 00:45:08,180
<font size="64">We fit right in that range.</font>

1824
00:45:07,840 --> 00:45:11,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Since 147 falls between 120 and 150, it qualifies!)</font>

1825
00:45:08,180 --> 00:45:09,780
<font size="64">- No way. - We fit right under 150.</font>

1826
00:45:09,780 --> 00:45:11,510
<font size="64">We can block anyone who tries to join us.</font>

1827
00:45:11,580 --> 00:45:13,850
<font size="64">You know what's great? They serve a summer dish.</font>

1828
00:45:13,850 --> 00:45:15,050
<font size="64">- I saw that. - Would you look at that?</font>

1829
00:45:14,520 --> 00:45:17,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The conditions are met, and it has everything they need!)</font>

1830
00:45:15,050 --> 00:45:16,350
<font size="64">We can all get what we want.</font>

1831
00:45:16,350 --> 00:45:18,290
<font size="64">- There's clear beef bone soup. - There's everything.</font>

1832
00:45:18,550 --> 00:45:19,790
<font size="64">- Wait. - Someone else is here.</font>

1833
00:45:19,790 --> 00:45:21,220
<font size="64">- Someone's coming? - Who is it?</font>

1834
00:45:20,960 --> 00:45:23,960
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just as things are getting good, a car approaches.)</font>

1835
00:45:21,320 --> 00:45:23,130
<font size="64">- Who is it? - I think it's Haha.</font>

1836
00:45:23,460 --> 00:45:25,330
<font size="64">- Just don't. - Are you kidding me?</font>

1837
00:45:24,130 --> 00:45:27,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They're doomed unless this person is 3 years old.)</font>

1838
00:45:25,330 --> 00:45:26,700
<font size="64">- Who is it? Just leave. - Unbelievable.</font>

1839
00:45:27,730 --> 00:45:29,900
<font size="64">Who is it? Let's see.</font>

1840
00:45:27,760 --> 00:45:30,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Don't stop and keep going.)</font>

1841
00:45:32,130 --> 00:45:36,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Which clueless uninvited guest just joined them?)</font>

1842
00:45:33,400 --> 00:45:34,440
<font size="64">Who's in the van?</font>

1843
00:45:37,370 --> 00:45:39,540
<font size="64">- Hoon, are you kidding me? - Darn.</font>

1844
00:45:39,110 --> 00:45:42,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(35-year-old Kang Hoon)</font>

1845
00:45:39,640 --> 00:45:42,110
<font size="64">- Just leave already. - That weasel.</font>

1846
00:45:42,210 --> 00:45:43,280
<font size="64">- Just go. - Go away already.</font>

1847
00:45:43,280 --> 00:45:44,380
<font size="64">- Leave. - What?</font>

1848
00:45:44,550 --> 00:45:45,650
<font size="64">But over there...</font>

1849
00:45:45,650 --> 00:45:47,650
<font size="64">- Just leave already. - The BBQ restaurant...</font>

1850
00:45:47,820 --> 00:45:49,890
<font size="64">- requires man-woman couples, - Leave!</font>

1851
00:45:48,220 --> 00:45:52,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He was already kicked out of the BBQ restaurant.)</font>

1852
00:45:49,890 --> 00:45:51,790
<font size="64">and only Seok Jin and Woo Min were there.</font>

1853
00:45:51,790 --> 00:45:52,960
<font size="64">- Really? - Yes.</font>

1854
00:45:53,390 --> 00:45:55,160
<font size="64">You push the total over 150.</font>

1855
00:45:53,620 --> 00:45:56,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's 182 in total.)</font>

1856
00:45:55,160 --> 00:45:56,460
<font size="64">- Exactly. - We can't have you here.</font>

1857
00:45:56,460 --> 00:45:57,660
<font size="64">Go to the other restaurant.</font>

1858
00:45:57,760 --> 00:45:59,130
<font size="64">- Exactly. - The Chinese restaurant.</font>

1859
00:45:59,130 --> 00:46:01,400
<font size="64">But I don't want to have Chinese food.</font>

1860
00:46:01,400 --> 00:46:03,070
<font size="64">You didn't mention sundaeguk earlier.</font>

1861
00:46:03,070 --> 00:46:05,330
<font size="64">- Why did you come here? - They serve kimchi here.</font>

1862
00:46:05,330 --> 00:46:06,370
<font size="64">Exactly.</font>

1863
00:46:06,340 --> 00:46:10,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 147 trio is attacking him with kimchi.)</font>

1864
00:46:06,370 --> 00:46:07,870
<font size="64">- What, then? - I don't want Chinese food.</font>

1865
00:46:07,870 --> 00:46:09,240
<font size="64">- Come on. - They don't serve kimchi...</font>

1866
00:46:09,240 --> 00:46:10,710
<font size="64">- with Chinese food. - Just go.</font>

1867
00:46:10,710 --> 00:46:12,770
<font size="64">- Where's the Chinese restaurant? - Why do I have to leave?</font>

1868
00:46:12,770 --> 00:46:14,880
<font size="64">- We were here first. - We already fit the requirement.</font>

1869
00:46:13,280 --> 00:46:16,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Gatekeeping)</font>

1870
00:46:14,880 --> 00:46:15,940
<font size="64">Where's the Chinese restaurant?</font>

1871
00:46:15,940 --> 00:46:16,980
<font size="64">I haven't made it over there yet.</font>

1872
00:46:16,980 --> 00:46:18,250
<font size="64">See how things are there.</font>

1873
00:46:18,510 --> 00:46:20,250
<font size="64">I don't mind Chinese food.</font>

1874
00:46:20,580 --> 00:46:22,080
<font size="64">- Maybe I should go there. - Why not?</font>

1875
00:46:22,150 --> 00:46:23,490
<font size="64">I'm craving Chinese right now.</font>

1876
00:46:23,550 --> 00:46:26,690
<font size="64">Why would you leave when we fit the requirement?</font>

1877
00:46:23,750 --> 00:46:26,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He doesn't understand.)</font>

1878
00:46:26,760 --> 00:46:28,020
<font size="64">Because Hoon joined us!</font>

1879
00:46:26,990 --> 00:46:29,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The jjamppong lover is ruining the game.)</font>

1880
00:46:28,020 --> 00:46:30,090
<font size="64">- What if someone else comes? - Let's count first.</font>

1881
00:46:30,130 --> 00:46:31,790
<font size="64">How old... Wait, you're 35.</font>

1882
00:46:31,790 --> 00:46:33,300
<font size="64">Don't we fit the requirement too?</font>

1883
00:46:33,130 --> 00:46:36,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's 129 in total, which meets the requirement.)</font>

1884
00:46:33,300 --> 00:46:34,900
<font size="64">We meet the requirement. It's over 120, right?</font>

1885
00:46:34,900 --> 00:46:36,270
<font size="64">- Adding 95 to... - You're over 120.</font>

1886
00:46:36,330 --> 00:46:37,570
<font size="64">- It works. - It still works.</font>

1887
00:46:37,570 --> 00:46:38,700
<font size="64">Get lost then.</font>

1888
00:46:39,230 --> 00:46:41,200
<font size="64">Get lost and don't come back.</font>

1889
00:46:41,200 --> 00:46:42,340
<font size="64">I'll see how things are...</font>

1890
00:46:42,340 --> 00:46:43,910
<font size="64">- at the Chinese restaurant. - Just go.</font>

1891
00:46:44,040 --> 00:46:45,240
<font size="64">This is great. Nice one, Hoon.</font>

1892
00:46:44,640 --> 00:46:48,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Will it stay as 129?)</font>

1893
00:46:45,240 --> 00:46:46,510
<font size="64">- We make a good group. - Right.</font>

1894
00:46:46,510 --> 00:46:47,680
<font size="64">- I like this trio. - We're in the safe zone.</font>

1895
00:46:47,680 --> 00:46:48,880
<font size="64">I like playing it safe.</font>

1896
00:46:48,940 --> 00:46:50,050
<font size="64">He's not picking up.</font>

1897
00:46:49,010 --> 00:46:51,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's still an even number at the Chinese restaurant.)</font>

1898
00:46:51,050 --> 00:46:52,280
<font size="64">Please let one more person be here.</font>

1899
00:46:51,410 --> 00:46:52,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chinese restaurant: Odd number)</font>

1900
00:46:52,950 --> 00:46:53,980
<font size="64">Well...</font>

1901
00:46:55,250 --> 00:46:56,390
<font size="64">Maybe you should go.</font>

1902
00:46:56,990 --> 00:46:57,990
<font size="64">Hye Jun, really?</font>

1903
00:46:58,620 --> 00:47:00,120
<font size="64">If you leave...</font>

1904
00:46:58,690 --> 00:47:01,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hye Jun doesn't give up.)</font>

1905
00:47:00,120 --> 00:47:01,890
<font size="64">I can share the gold I earn.</font>

1906
00:47:01,060 --> 00:47:02,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If you leave, I can share the gold I earn.)</font>

1907
00:47:02,560 --> 00:47:04,260
<font size="64">- How many would I get? - I can give you some of it.</font>

1908
00:47:02,620 --> 00:47:04,630
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Tempted)</font>

1909
00:47:04,290 --> 00:47:06,600
<font size="64">You'll get 30 gold bars if you end up here alone.</font>

1910
00:47:06,600 --> 00:47:08,700
<font size="64">- Yes, 30 gold bars. - I want at least 10 of them.</font>

1911
00:47:08,930 --> 00:47:10,270
<font size="64">Of course!</font>

1912
00:47:11,030 --> 00:47:13,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She's so easy to persuade.)</font>

1913
00:47:11,200 --> 00:47:13,040
<font size="64">- Of course you'll get that much. - Really?</font>

1914
00:47:13,100 --> 00:47:16,210
<font size="64">I even thought about asking for 13 gold bars.</font>

1915
00:47:16,210 --> 00:47:18,810
<font size="64">Let's say I ended up here alone and got all 30 gold bars,</font>

1916
00:47:16,470 --> 00:47:18,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They reached a deal where she gets to take all the gold bars.)</font>

1917
00:47:19,580 --> 00:47:21,280
<font size="64">- I'll give you 11 of them. - Really? Okay.</font>

1918
00:47:20,980 --> 00:47:23,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The deal is made, but Haha walks in.)</font>

1919
00:47:21,280 --> 00:47:23,110
<font size="64">Wait, is this the Chinese restaurant?</font>

1920
00:47:24,750 --> 00:47:25,750
<font size="64">I mean...</font>

1921
00:47:24,810 --> 00:47:26,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Awkward)</font>

1922
00:47:26,820 --> 00:47:28,020
<font size="64">Why don't we go somewhere else?</font>

1923
00:47:27,220 --> 00:47:30,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They need to kick Haha out for their plan to work.)</font>

1924
00:47:31,220 --> 00:47:34,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Someone is calling Hye Jun.)</font>

1925
00:47:31,890 --> 00:47:33,020
<font size="64">- Hello? - No one's here.</font>

1926
00:47:33,560 --> 00:47:34,560
<font size="64">Woo Min, where are you?</font>

1927
00:47:34,890 --> 00:47:35,960
<font size="64">The BBQ restaurant. What about you?</font>

1928
00:47:36,330 --> 00:47:37,930
<font size="64">You should come to the naengmyeon place.</font>

1929
00:47:39,260 --> 00:47:41,830
<font size="64">The BBQ restaurant requires mixed-gender couples.</font>

1930
00:47:41,960 --> 00:47:43,570
<font size="64">All this place needs is one female member.</font>

1931
00:47:43,930 --> 00:47:45,370
<font size="64">Does that mean there are four of you there?</font>

1932
00:47:46,100 --> 00:47:48,070
<font size="64">No, it'll just be me and you.</font>

1933
00:47:48,400 --> 00:47:49,400
<font size="64">Really?</font>

1934
00:47:48,640 --> 00:47:51,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Okay!)</font>

1935
00:47:49,500 --> 00:47:52,310
<font size="64">- Just get here right away. - Got it.</font>

1936
00:47:52,340 --> 00:47:54,840
<font size="64">Please. You have to come here right now.</font>

1937
00:47:54,840 --> 00:47:56,010
<font size="64">Okay, fine.</font>

1938
00:47:56,210 --> 00:47:58,950
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While Hye Jun thinks of running,)</font>

1939
00:47:59,310 --> 00:48:00,980
<font size="64">- Are you with there with Hye Jun? - Yes.</font>

1940
00:47:59,950 --> 00:48:02,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ddochi is talking with Seok Sam.)</font>

1941
00:48:01,080 --> 00:48:02,280
<font size="64">Aren't you in the mood for barbecue?</font>

1942
00:48:02,680 --> 00:48:04,350
<font size="64">We can feast on meat...</font>

1943
00:48:04,350 --> 00:48:05,890
<font size="64">if you come here with Hye Jun.</font>

1944
00:48:05,920 --> 00:48:07,820
<font size="64">- Naengmyeon too. - Got it.</font>

1945
00:48:06,590 --> 00:48:09,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's also telling her to come to the BBQ restaurant.)</font>

1946
00:48:07,820 --> 00:48:09,560
<font size="64">They also have cold kimchi noodles. What will it be?</font>

1947
00:48:09,560 --> 00:48:12,460
<font size="64">Say "apple" if you'll be here and say "strawberry" if not.</font>

1948
00:48:15,360 --> 00:48:16,400
<font size="64">Apple.</font>

1949
00:48:17,630 --> 00:48:19,570
<font size="64">Got it. I'll wait for you.</font>

1950
00:48:17,670 --> 00:48:20,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They agree to meet at the BBQ place too.)</font>

